#: scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21869db8d018863dc899c0ac3148dd2ce85c17b6b63f6a0d935a09ba6a88f18d
#. default-sha256: 1e1ad0e865759e2e6a9789edb66e08b25f437366fe9bf20bee55bbd16fdcbaf8
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_49EC72D7_464F_45AE_83CA_75CC4C81372F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫Several days had passed since the "
"package arrived; ⟪k:12⟫the end of my third week living in the mansion was drawing near."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫物资运来之后，已过去了数日——⟪k:12⟫"
"⟪k:13⟫而从我住在这座馆算起，⟪k:14⟫也有了二十多天。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fac54209376c13726a3c7effcfc6a2171144d729805a3df7743aac0f6a750ada
#. default-sha256: b53ecb6206f034222bca4b37ad0616ff5208fe5f5dc80d9c2efafc94fa02b812
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_6150F9D5_5DDC_43DF_A513_607F62A542F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel wasn’t getting any friendlier, either. ⟪k:1⟫He continued to either snub or bluntly "
"dismiss me whenever we crossed paths."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那件事以后，⟪k:1⟫米歇尔一直对我保持着冷淡的态度。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫不断地用拒绝的话语疏远着我……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b86bf4fc28b81c075e11d4a75791687aadafb8b787cceb26f7a3818184b7f0d2
#. default-sha256: f9562b8f563bfdf65a2fa1d9e352ddaafcdcff6bb341c292aad11640ec345737
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_653649AD_016A_4720_AF8F_1972915C5AE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t understand why he acted that way around me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……我不明白，⟪k:1⟫究竟为什么他对我是那种态度。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0dbfd3d2e6fd143dedf1953cd9a052dc740e8bea6b19476c314831f0e6c0502d
#. default-sha256: 14bb9df03e4aacda8dbb7d313e3092b19fcd1f9292c5e23931157bbcc4cf82d1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A8D1483C_9648_4012_B28C_2634220D8C98"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But there was little point in asking when he seemed to think there was little point in "
"talking to me at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫也曾想过询问他理由，⟪k:1⟫但根本找不到机会交流。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫大概，⟪k:4⟫他从一开始就觉得，⟪k:5⟫和"
"我交流是没有任何意义吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40cf48e3629a75b63deb9c714603af28541513af55a91465afef4d328104594a
#. default-sha256: ec994b8586baba7a71dad7493e3f9f5051b632deb34ac6768d59cb134534579f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F46A383E_C563_49CD_9477_40CF746506DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although at first I had been sure there was some way to get him to warm up to me,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫最初，⟪k:1⟫我一直想要和他缩近距离……但是……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d631baf713dc975c8b1066e89a9d8a7767adee5846c34909075472456a6aa2b
#. default-sha256: daba425376dbc815067492276b78a33d23d164ecb5e054f5dacf60839d1423ca
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_424348E1_F5B1_4CF9_B0EF_CE05648831F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫the more time I spent in the mansion, the more my willpower began to feel like it was at its "
"breaking point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫和他度过了这些天后，⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫不管是我的心意，⟪k:3⟫抑或那些想法，⟪k:4⟫都已无法保持原状。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb1e902f85ad3081c646d338f670ff21e6b279b723e5f181202c7b4965e6e3a5
#. default-sha256: 75ff2f887dc48623616dd90d5f4d7061180d0f648008be5360fa3fe7d022a435
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_75DBADEE_BB49_47B3_98C8_A69797C4FF12"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could tell myself to stay positive until I was blue in the face,⟪k:1⟫but it would only "
"work for so long."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫就算我想要积极地面对……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫但是，也已经到了极限。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 235f0a697a8fde7773fb4ca39ac3c3e5a1edb0d9fa1dca3594223a64090bc780
#. default-sha256: fbe38ccc9fabac13aee0db607bf18cd105c30627fdf36aa2dcdc24bbda9a3e3a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8A2906C_3079_44F8_ADFE_0610C9535338"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(The one pretty place in the whole house...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫（果然，⟪k:2⟫只有这里……⟪k:3⟫一直那么美丽……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef8db724ba985fe3dad25021c9172225c7ba8476b5128b7cfd928852ef9caa3f
#. default-sha256: 65c38ad23fad8df1e11d54233ea52ff9401ee75ca0a9759d61686357e683d04c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9DED7EEC_0722_4C45_9EF7_A984612FE73D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m glad he hasn’t covered it back up.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（幸好没有让幕帘遮挡……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 415364140b095f33e44f9f02b4d495c2061fc6e5846f27b47140cf984d4aa61b
#. default-sha256: a2f77036c39f6097d7cd2679d16550a0f11d7edf71ec3100540bf2c73a463d02
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_65804540_F115_420D_AE61_DAB5CE7E94E9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blue moonlight shone quietly through the stained-glass window,⟪k:1⟫vainly illuminating some "
"of the room."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫眼前的彩绘玻璃背负着月光……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫正透出空幽的绿色月光，⟪k:3⟫静谧地洒在房间内。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24f0f434f75e54f42251d0a40b74e80bbba65f79637310fb20f505be791f931d
#. default-sha256: f53c64b1a9468f1e82a5505f99fcc9c77bc46b4753faf6fc8d89268c97be3d21
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B0B8F114_8698_4BC0_86F8_3007E9A895A9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hadn’t noticed until now, but the room with the stained-glass window appeared to be "
"modeled after a chapel."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我之前都没有注意到，⟪k:1⟫这间彩绘玻璃的房间，⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫构造仿佛就如同教堂一样。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af22b248faf544bd935c318208530e1f128dd2a2bf3bbe5aca10595ad4404077
#. default-sha256: 222879ac894fcfee030517d9d8b693b3c39d19db9cdfc1c174421b93c7f1b6cb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A0C7AE40_F8C8_4EDA_820A_38D0F5F09337"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Rows of pews faced the window, below which sat what used to be a pulpit."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫——整列的长椅面朝彩绘玻璃摆放着。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫另外，⟪k:3⟫玻璃的正下方设着「曾经」是讲坛的东西。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b772f85370d08a4ee05f04a6fb99ca51ff8dc3ad6759b39adb082f534d338ac
#. default-sha256: d374ca7d76404e2262f0893c8ce6e6ba6344b213f882bfaafb104b0d8832bbe2
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8C9CA69D_1F12_443C_9D1B_FEB57319275B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was very little left of it, though, and an awkward length of silver was mounted to the "
"pulpit’s front face—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫之所以说「曾经」，⟪k:1⟫是因为讲坛现在已经破损不堪。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫在那上面，⟪k:4⟫孤零零地残留着半"
"截细长的银质棍状物。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e114f2fe58bd4be1d978a075116598b1e3baa4688c8b7594d0fe6c2a032d7a2
#. default-sha256: 0eef08d5b249823a8667c9bc302bd92c5fc4b7ce08871b5a903f094a0d954879
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_7264E601_7DDD_4CA2_9E95_82FC86D64C48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫what was, I assumed, formerly a cross."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫或许，⟪k:1⟫那个东西原来……是十字架吧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 400b3ab3e5a3dc4e7a3ce19068f1dd3efb84878035d13f973726e07c1e447bb4
#. default-sha256: da63cf0b8e775a5972dd5701567465b082e24e55c5b6211d6760d3d854b22326
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF7BE4A5_DE3F_454B_884D_538236B1ADDD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Upon further reflection, rather than facing the window, the pews seemed to be pointed at the "
"pulpit—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or perhaps the cross hanging on it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那么，与其说这些长椅是面朝着彩绘玻璃，⟪k:1⟫不如说是面朝讲坛的神父——⟪k:2⟫或者，⟪k:3⟫是面朝着十"
"字架。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f44929343bff61521e042c4e85f8c3faf93c3085552fb64515d48e82dc4a4db
#. default-sha256: 69ea93774bcf5371dba4bc21055a4f5ae0f4bba2df0c0c9dc8ab0e95b8c1f9ca
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_8806818E_A5AA_4012_BC56_0518E7F4D082"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure why there would be a chapel in a mansion, but I had no one to ask about it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫为什么在这座馆里，⟪k:1⟫会如此不可思议的……有教堂的存在？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫但我的这些疑惑，⟪k:4⟫却无处"
"可问。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79391c5d8901e9ce2fc03d2cb1e2fe648f8f8253f8e48cb473e390f1ab5a333f
#. default-sha256: b2ecdbf7d8adb5c0c168300fe70b8b12832e550e82ac9da86844111261cfdcd1
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_79CFBF33_6D18_4F97_81E6_C68B8B04EAB1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫(For a house of this size, a statue of Christ or the Virgin Mary seems more appropriate.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（像这样规模的房子里，⟪k:1⟫放上耶稣和玛利亚的雕像不正好合适吗）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a1c2028f75c75fbf1c2237abdec161fac330d933828786bb81251d89bb818a8
#. default-sha256: 32fde32a4c8105b217d9092cef7071f0418da1b71ed110c80c508fe7fa57995b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_85244C87_58DA_4179_A1C6_C3252AEFA550"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(It’s a very well made chapel, at any rate...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（而且，⟪k:1⟫这间屋子也修缮得如此完整……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5fb6be4f4bc2cc7b46581fc0b62bfb94e15b29d62bc57dcbe1f500a146d7275
#. default-sha256: d02989f0a4281aaba62e649af9c739240e481475646ac17d289b90b0d401df39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_9103FB9B_FF59_407A_B1F5_4CDFE900CFFD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ae54ec06968eed60faa78224b9ef123474ae3a412cada04341a1c9beada0037
#. default-sha256: 81d4c0425047027ef24bea9ca18540d04ffba7d079500285ea89be75a75e301d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D29F27E2_EC0C_4621_956D_C2A2CD962404"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I doubted Michel had had it built for himself. ⟪k:1⟫There would be no reason for him to "
"cover the window if that were the case."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫是出于米歇尔的意愿而准备的房间吗——应该不是。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫因为如果是这样，⟪k:3⟫他就不会用幕帘遮挡"
"彩绘玻璃了……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 445b300e20d22c06ab246fbbc6c64d8a395e175af494d54a88b17e18a51d4806
#. default-sha256: 371dce451aebc011ca48a77549336571e1358fa2266f9e6fb241c991ccf4ca5d
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_3A7A3407_AF3B_41E4_924C_5F34794B7486"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nor had I ever seen him come to pray."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何况，⟪k:1⟫我也从没见过他来这里做祷告。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f33be663b00d3eda5eacad50dd6bc44a238e8a4780e50d7648d397fa9638c86
#. default-sha256: f5c82417f32faed3374c734e854d8f2ba5f1db898f0d2fa48c6b9488dfc8ba24
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BF6E0F10_588D_4AFA_9436_A66EFD5A59CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He doesn’t seem like one to believe in God.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（他看上去并不信神……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61d22e945ad1e347d8b3e4e13f7cb6a1dc62b9d075188d6e685da5b10b513d92
#. default-sha256: c5be3c947b6982f0402723b204879e211c80bdeb34ef00e5163ea5b363b2bbe3
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0A56A746_2279_407F_84FC_A7A3CE7E50E5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(God...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（……神……⟪k:1⟫吗……）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e80b99fe25e5d7d9055859d520e711c5ba8a9b0e370fd2fef80fa5cb1d812f59
#. default-sha256: 93d8c058554072ca9129d97c1890067d22744e298f6c57d873df84e3d66ec186
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_E5007458_122E_4125_9932_037BFC3EE5D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I’m not even sure if I...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（其实我也………）"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0831ea5622fbd8eba8a1de22ec2b033ccfed59e7df6fc753a7129e94ab4533fe
#. default-sha256: 4129ee0b8ba9b20bdf978c6f5f7405b5b159c28ad288c54ce95a3e1ed535b349
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F9324163_17D1_4F00_8DBD_339C28934087"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If God ⟪k:1⟫really⟪k:2⟫ existed, then surely the world would be a much more pleasant, "
"peaceful place."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫如果世上，真的有神存在的话。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫那么这个世界，应该更和平美满才对——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B5F3B961_B5CF_45E1_9686_D8F1AD89AF1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 028e903d97f28fe9fc37d4f078cf9ff7aa8dc431aca27ea264e1945a1eb3d47e
#. default-sha256: 72d7934c277b5ccc803fa20e8cefe16a502ace661978f3bb236fd311c4f6bb95
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B5F3B961_B5CF_45E1_9686_D8F1AD89AF1C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No unfair disparities in money or power. ⟪k:1⟫No senseless misfortune.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I certainly "
"wouldn’t have found myself here, either..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫不会有不讲理的阶级差距，⟪k:1⟫不会有不讲理的命运。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫更不会……让我被迫留在这里……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_41BF1485_75AA_4EEA_940F_4F8D64CB0688
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
