"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……我是商家的女儿，⟪k:3⟫家里的店铺开在首都的大街上。⟪k:4⟫父亲因为传染病离世了。⟪k:5⟫"
"只剩我和母亲、⟪k:6⟫姐姐三人相依为命。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_5A82401E_5D9A_4708_898A_C2F4F14E7BCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 277f07a30e0053b009766d45c6208c923f1648971c8f745641421c1e76c80104
#. default-sha256: b8fb382e2198754369a600945e097660cad27ccdd50968107e16f0320c6ead18
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_5A82401E_5D9A_4708_898A_C2F4F14E7BCC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It would be a lie to say business was doing well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫铺子的生意根本谈不上景气。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CF63D0AB_643C_4138_8E9E_91DC1B719EC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c8418a801d7ec8fbed07775366b220a94ac441bee658dc0e028b8fb0b0ff39b
#. default-sha256: bfa94186b0ed7cb61e0f565f00288e565e1519e712ef59f03a1024e289e28eed
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CF63D0AB_643C_4138_8E9E_91DC1B719EC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We struggled to squeak by day-to-day after taxes...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but we couldn’t just abandon "
"the shop and leave the capital either..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫再加上领主收取的高额税金，⟪k:1⟫我们一家每天的生活困苦不堪……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫但是，⟪k:4⟫也不能就这么"
"丢下铺子搬离首都……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_778A2AAE_CCB7_42BA_B2C6_85F3D97DBA6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7156e13ac2afea652845bcafe0c25bf3cb680d04b4ddc764a0d451e1fff227dd
#. default-sha256: a04b4ff3a6d54e9b107b665e2c0e289f8315de0202a3d3fea38f4e56da30ea32
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_778A2AAE_CCB7_42BA_B2C6_85F3D97DBA6F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫so we tried to make the best of what we were able to take in between the three of us."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因为，至少现在，⟪k:1⟫我们还能过上三餐温饱的朴素生活。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0A4E61B0_4FB0_44B4_A6E4_86DA8AEAA2BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf55f3e5a1e159bbcdef06a50eee8445987996397403f511ca56dfb83ea13ff4
#. default-sha256: bf6a42a59a6f40d0dee33ed39394c7f54efeda76ca5fa9ddd378dc7c3689f5a0
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0A4E61B0_4FB0_44B4_A6E4_86DA8AEAA2BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Then, my sister fell in love with a moderately well-off aristocrat. ⟪k:1⟫Both my mom and I "
"were supportive of her and her desire to marry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫就在这时，⟪k:1⟫姐姐坠入了爱河。⟪k:2⟫男方是个中层贵族。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫我和妈妈都衷心祝福着她，⟪k:5⟫"
"希望两人能早日成婚。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 911d3874912ac3a319c9dca42b03ac3e7f61c801553195ee2410c3589945bda8
#. default-sha256: 18497d9587ba8b0346abb7515e5963423f3ef86218e4a843aa5687d445b0518b
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_CE4F5CD4_0E48_451B_9DA3_6F0C0607605C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But their union almost fell apart because she was “not suitable” for him. ⟪k:1⟫Merchants "
"were hardly the lowest class—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫然而，⟪k:1⟫对方却用「不够门当户对」的理由，⟪k:2⟫取消了亲事。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫这不是因为商人家庭「地"
"位低下」——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0949ED31_09F9_472D_B559_50857937E097
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4843feaffbf7d220b4d24ef4703f60c1e9c83a8a9021a512f0841994d7888bcc
