msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_2950F572_63BF_42D2_90BD_943E614D3831"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If only we had money, my sister could get married.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If only we had money, my mom "
"wouldn’t have to work so hard."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只要有钱，⟪k:1⟫姐姐就能结婚嫁人。⟪k:2⟫只要有钱，⟪k:3⟫妈妈就能变得轻松。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0F44F0A0_0406_4329_AD33_CC802B3A9D7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff333b1542f1b8943c8133e6a3b6c7a919499d89e941c823cd5ffe6893ef12a4
