msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was then that someone from the distinguished Bollinger estate approached me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……就在那个时候……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫从声名显赫的博林杰家传来了消息——"

#: scenario5:scenario5_631D3376_1203_4553_AAA4_E3A30A8168E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82a9bc393c1bd3a758ca041d9f6820e6fad645fdc67eb5b597167f13d140233b
