msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_631D3376_1203_4553_AAA4_E3A30A8168E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He said they were in need of abigails and would love to have me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He said that if I "
"agreed to work for them, the Bollinger estate would take care of my family."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「由于女仆人手不足，⟪k:1⟫请您务必来我们家侍奉」。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫如果我同意下来的话，⟪k:4⟫就能解决"
"家里的困境吧……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_60CFB76B_A66C_410C_8351_588DB472D762
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 85280d1c7179339728e009beb947f978dff26f4997f157d1c664c03724c6029b
