msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_60CFB76B_A66C_410C_8351_588DB472D762"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Generally speaking, noble houses took abigails from other, lower-ranked noble houses. ⟪k:1⟫"
"It was unthinkable for someone of my status to receive such an offer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫本来……女仆这个身份，⟪k:1⟫就该由那些配得上贵族阶级的人去做。⟪k:2⟫像我这种人会受到邀请，⟪k:3⟫完"
"全是没有想到的事。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_122E592A_6FF7_4F3E_B4FF_E5AA136890FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98762d1c60191b5db8605ea6353ea1fab17ea69f80f27ca454aeaae957425b64
