msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_122E592A_6FF7_4F3E_B4FF_E5AA136890FA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I took it as a once-in-a-lifetime chance and accepted the offer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫也因此，⟪k:1⟫我把这个机遇当成一次难得的侥幸——⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫对信使带来的邀请，⟪k:4⟫默默地点了头……"

