msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not just children. ⟪k:1⟫Adults as well.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫They fear demons, witches, and curses—⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫anything impure or not of this world."
