"⟪k:0⟫没错。⟪k:1⟫即使是成年人，⟪k:2⟫也会对恶魔、魔女、诅咒……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫这些不应存于世上的不净之物，"
"⟪k:5⟫感到深深的恐惧。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_2B7D2F46_2DFB_4137_8567_D75248BD5D66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52ed700794055fc7ba3c81df3c05d88495f55aa87cafc66782a9503647d26f1f
