msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I had long since gotten used to being viewed as such.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It didn’t sadden me. ⟪k:3⟫"
"It didn’t disappoint me. ⟪k:4⟫It didn’t pain me."
